  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="unit_cade_cbb20166abbc2ea50e8d92ddd7d08b06698921b62c78e68590b2b34fb7c7044ad1">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>General term referring to systems of quantities taken as unified standards of measure, usually represent a uniform system established by a nation. The regulation of weights and measures is necessary for science, industry, and commerce. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
